{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265KO7o7YVis1794493247.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>路透社報道，內地部分有軍方背景的高等學府，透過供應商採購到受美國出口管制的輝達先進晶片。中方表示，堅決反對美方泛化國家安全概念。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧稱：「你提到的具體情況我不了解，但是中方在美國輸華晶片問題上的立場是一貫的。同時，我們堅決反對美方泛化國家安全概念，劃設各種名目的歧視性清單，無理打壓中國機構。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:23:54.580313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T14:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.987170+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:17:18.515600+00:00","content_hash":"ab32ca19a3141ca699610fa93981156c066a0937b9c5757a2527e7460ebe8a5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:23:54.580313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}